# sabotage=PassesDropCalls behind a pass over the whole program: the check is shown a copy of the first body that has such a call, without it. Nobody answers for what goes behind this pass: the build stops
# FORM: Prepared
# RUN: pass NarrowConstantVariables
# DIAGNOSTIC: VerificationFailedAfterPass 1
# OPTIONS: check=VerifyEachPass sabotage=PassesDropCalls
# PROGRAM-OF: passes-drop-calls-left-alone.ir
